<h4 class="wp-block-heading">优点：</h4>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>大存储容量</li>



<li>高品质视频和流媒体</li>



<li>从任意位置上传</li>



<li>视频隐私和安全</li>
</ul>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">缺点：</h4>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>不支持中国视频传输</li>
</ul>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">上传指南和规格：</h4>



